# 🔥 Smart Helmet System – Final Architecture & Specification

---

## 🧾 FINAL COMPONENT LIST (Optimized Architecture)

### 🧠 Core Processing

* **Main MCU:**
  **STM32U585CIU6**

  * Ultra-low-power MCU
  * ARM Cortex-M33 @ 160 MHz

* **Comms + Audio MCU:**
  **ESP32-S3-WROOM-1**

  * WiFi + BLE
  * DSP capable
  * I2S support

---

### 📡 Sensors

* **IMU:** ICM-42688-P
* **Barometer:** BMP390
* **Temperature Sensor:** TMP117
* **PPG Sensor:** MAX30102

---

### 👆 Human Interface

* **Touch Sensors:** 2× TTP223
* **IR Sensor:** Low-power proximity module
  *(VCNL4010 or discrete IR pair)*

---

### 🎧 Audio System

* **Microphones:** 2× INMP441 (I2S digital)
* **Amplifier:** MAX98357A (I2S Class-D)
* **Speakers:**

  * 2× 0.5W OR
  * 1× 1W

---

### 🖥️ Display

* **OLED:** SSD1306 (128×64, I2C)

---

### 🔋 Power System

* **Battery:** 2S Li-ion (7.4V, 1000mAh)
* **Buck Converter:** TPS5430 / MP1584 → 5V
* **LDO (3.3V):** MCP1700 / TLV75533

---

### 🔌 Power Control (Critical)

* **Load Switch / MOSFETs:** AO3400
  *(or TPS22910A for cleaner implementation)*

#### Used for:

* ESP32 power gating
* Audio amplifier enable/disable
* Sensor block switching

---

### 🔗 Communication Interfaces

* **UART:** STM32 ↔ ESP32
* **I2C:** Sensors + OLED
* **I2S:** Audio chain

---

## ⚙️ SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE SUMMARY

### 🧠 STM32U5 (Always-On Brain)

Handles:

* Wear detection (touch + IR)
* Sensor fusion (IMU + barometer)
* Crash detection
* Power domain control
* Wake control for ESP32

---

### 📡 ESP32-S3 (Event-Based Node)

Handles:

* Bluetooth audio (A2DP)
* DSP (mic + speaker)
* ESP-NOW / WiFi communication
* Voice communication

> Default state: **OFF or Light Sleep**

---

## 🔌 POWER DOMAIN DESIGN

| Domain        | Components           | State           |
| ------------- | -------------------- | --------------- |
| Always ON     | STM32 + touch + IR   | Always active   |
| Sensor Domain | IMU, barometer, temp | Duty-cycled     |
| High Power    | ESP32 + Audio        | Event-triggered |

---

## 📊 DETAILED POWER SPEC SHEET

### 💤 Idle Mode (Helmet OFF)

| Component           | Current   |
| ------------------- | --------- |
| STM32U5 (low power) | 2–5 mA    |
| Touch + IR          | ~3 mA     |
| **Total**           | **~8 mA** |

---

### 🟢 Monitoring Mode (Helmet ON, no audio)

| Component      | Current    |
| -------------- | ---------- |
| STM32U5 active | 25 mA      |
| Sensors active | 15 mA      |
| OLED (dimmed)  | 10 mA      |
| **Total**      | **~50 mA** |

---

### 🔴 Active Mode (Audio + Communication)

| Component       | Current     |
| --------------- | ----------- |
| STM32           | 30 mA       |
| ESP32-S3        | 120 mA      |
| Audio Amplifier | 150 mA      |
| Sensors         | 15 mA       |
| **Total**       | **~315 mA** |

---

## 📈 REALISTIC USAGE MODEL

* **50%** → Monitoring mode
* **30%** → Idle / low activity
* **20%** → Active (audio + communication)

